I assume you mean a gray stone, not a boulder.

The usual technique is to turn on autopickup (and include the '*' class 
of objects in your pickup_types).  Then you'll pick up the stone before 
you teleport.

To avoid teleporting, you could use a grappling hook, or you could
teleport the stone, or you could acquire teleport control or magic
resistance.

But whatever you do, don't top-post.

